The firmware is built with [`firmware/build.sh`](https://github.com/jarvissax/rondo/blob/main/firmware/build.sh) from the y1-community&#x27;s [Android 4.2 base ROM](https://github.com/y1-community/y1-ata-rom) (0.1, Type A). Its scatter file, preloader and flashing files are the base ROM&#x27;s, unchanged.

